  <item>
    <title>综艺剧本那些事：专业导演解读“迪幂孟扎”出圈；恶剪和黑热搜是怎么回事丨V3</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63ca8ed1531dadd2b16cb26a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63ca8ed1531dadd2b16cb26a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Jan 2023 12:53:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>给大家拜个年，新一期揭秘“综艺剧本”主题的观娱心理学更新啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们请来了专业综艺导演，一起揭秘综艺剧本那些事儿~艺人和节目组开撕了怎么办？恶剪和黑热搜是怎么回事？怎么看赵樱子的出圈？是节目组设计的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期由于线上信号偶尔会断，导致某些问题收声不太好，后期有重新录制，请听友们谅解~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期热聊嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>打工导：一线综艺导演，参与执导多部热门综艺</span></p><span></span><p><span>糊糊：闯荡10年的贵圈媒体人</span></p><span></span><p><span>菜菜：一线文娱打工人（本期串场）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期要点：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> 综艺到底有剧本么？哪类综艺的剧本更重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 节目热搜如何操作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="368">06:08</a> 艺人的人设、剧情线如何设置？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a>“综艺咖”、综艺常客其实屈指可数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="697">11:37</a> 类似赵樱子的爆款综艺人物，导演怎么看？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a> 综艺导演有门槛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 如何邀约艺人与综艺“角色”的分配</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">19:43</a> 导演和编剧侧重点的不同，综艺好看的要素是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1783">29:43</a> 出圈桥段的产生，以《披荆斩棘》张智霖婚礼为例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2109">35:09</a> 节目组会给艺人写台词么？“迪幂孟扎”也会是安排吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2324">38:44</a> 艺人开撕“恶剪”的成因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2636">43:56</a> “黑热搜”的处理和粉丝群体的逐渐成熟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3021">50:21</a> 艺人和节目组开撕后怎么办？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3191">53:11</a> 提名合作好的艺人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">54:20</a> 综艺“后期”卷到什么程度了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3591">59:51</a> 艺人和经纪人“一个唱红脸一个唱白脸”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3753">1:02:33</a> 在综艺里做观众也是个专业差事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgRJy7nKzV63d4O8oQIDWhXBrP6y.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luwxm4E2kVanXdRMct9CNjeyyK5Y.m4a" length="64078511" type="audio/mp4"/>
