    <guid isPermaLink="false">632a8048e67030aadb38e1ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 21 Sep 2022 03:08:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们一起趁热聊聊“塌房”和“公关”，有没有接触过饭圈的听众都可以来凑个热闹~~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期热聊阵容：</span></p><span></span><p><span>棉棉 前娱乐记者，现艺人团队成员（本期艺人经纪代表）</span></p><span></span><p><span>小白 入行不久的一线文娱打工人（本期反复横跳的吃瓜小编代表）</span></p><span></span><p><span>菜菜 入行6年的一线文娱打工人（本期饭圈心碎代表）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期进度条：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>“前校草”到底在挣扎什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 粉丝何以“执迷不悟”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="668">11:08</a> 粉丝和艺人的权力结构</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="850">14:10</a> 饭圈心理大复盘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1087">18:07</a> “洗脑包”三大特点解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1327">22:07</a> 艺人的消费品化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1537">25:37</a> “塌房”到底如何定义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 流量明星时代过去了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2105">35:05</a> 影视投资成了高风险行业</span></p>]]></description>
